	"data": "Concept: Health & Sleep Patterns\n\nThe Core Pattern\nSleep and energy are the foundational constraint on everything else cithoreal builds. 240+ journal mentions — more than almost any project.\n\n\"The way that I wake up determines whether or not my neck aches for the day and that determines my whole energy levels for the day.\"\n\nSleep Schedule Oscillation\n\n| Phase | Bedtime | Wake | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Childhood/college default | 1am+ | 9am | Sleep as avoidance/spiral |\n| Target | 12am | 8am…",
